# The server image copies a few folders of the client (server/Dockerfile): the battle
# simulation (client/src/battle/sim), the maps and the shared profile rules. The rest of
# the client isn't needed, but `client` must NOT be ignored whole or those COPYs fail
# ("not found") - so only the big or private bits are left out.
**/node_modules
client/dist
client/public
client/scripts
**/data
**/*.db
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.github
